The per-layer RSA curves reveal a functional bifurcation after L12 (Figure~\ref{fig:rsa_perlayer_curve}): readout $\rho$ declines gradually ($0.628 \to 0.584$) while image\_mean $\rho$ drops sharply ($0.628 \to 0.422$).
